<title>UK: Polypipe buys toilet seat manufacturer.</title>
<headline>Polypipe buys toilet seat manufacturer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polypipe Plc, a diversified plastic buildings products manufacturer, said on Tuesday that it has agreed to buy Celmac Ltd for an initial 10.5 million stg in shares.</p>
<p>It will also pay a further 400,000 stg in cash six months from completion.</p>
<p>Celmac manufactures plastic toilet seats.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
